[38;5;231m⏺[39m Word boundary it is. Here's the short design — then I'll stop for your go-ahead.

  [1mChange:[0m one new block in [38;5;153mformat.js[39m, [38;5;153mtruncate: <number>[39m, placed after the case transforms and before [38;5;153mprefix[39m/[38;5;153msuffix[39m.

  [34mif[39m (options.truncate) {
