  introduce one.

  Two things worth naming: the word-boundary rule means [38;5;153mformat("a-very-long-hyphenated-token", { truncate: 20 })[39m falls
  back to a hard cut, since hyphens aren't boundaries here — only whitespace is. And [38;5;153mtruncate: 0[39m is falsy, so it's a
